{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_008_ko_008_0010_0010", "id": "ko_008_0010_0010_0001", "offset": 1, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "『여씨춘추(呂氏春秋)』는 후한 말 고유(高誘)에 의하여 최초의 주석이 이루어졌는데, 참고문헌의 한계로 자의적인 해석이 이루어져 오류가 적지 않았다고 한다. 청대 고증학의 성행으로 필원(畢沅)에 의하여 『呂氏春秋新校正』이 완성되면서 전면적인 교정 작업이 시도되어 본격적인 연구의 계기가 마련되었다(정하현 옮김, 2011, 『여씨춘추』, 소명출판, 18쪽). 원문의 본주(本注)는 고유(高誘)의 주석(注釋)을 따랐다.", "type": "번역주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_008_ko_008_0010_0010", "id": null, "offset": 11, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "高注: 反, 叛.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_008_ko_008_0010_0010", "id": null, "offset": 20, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 3, "text": "高注: 踐, 往.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_008_ko_008_0010_0010", "id": null, "offset": 33, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 4, "text": "高注: 象, 獸名也.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_008_ko_008_0010_0010", "id": null, "offset": 82, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 5, "text": "高注: 三象, 周公所作樂名. 嘉, 美也. 尙, 久也. 自黃帝以來. 功成作樂. 故曰「非獨爲一世之所造也.」", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_008_ko_008_0020_0010", "id": null, "offset": 13, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "高注: 太公望, 河內人也. 於周 豐·鎬爲東, 故曰東夷之士.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_008_ko_008_0020_0010", "id": null, "offset": 23, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "高注: 主, 謂賢君.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_008_ko_008_0020_0010", "id": null, "offset": 29, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 3, "text": "高注: 文, 諡也. 經天緯地曰文.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_008_ko_008_0020_0010", "id": null, "offset": 38, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 4, "text": "高注: 渭, 水名, 近豐·鎬, 文王所邑也. 觀視文王之德, 能有天下也.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_008_ko_008_0030_0010", "id": null, "offset": 12, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "高注: 興, 作也.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_008_ko_008_0030_0010", "id": null, "offset": 27, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "高注: 讎, 用也.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_008_ko_008_0030_0010", "id": null, "offset": 55, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 3, "text": "高注: 禁, 止也.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_008_ko_008_0040_0010", "id": null, "offset": 12, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "高注: 不違民欲.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_008_ko_008_0040_0010", "id": null, "offset": 19, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "高注: 巨橋, 紂倉名.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_008_ko_008_0040_0010", "id": null, "offset": 33, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 3, "text": "高注: 鹿臺, 紂錢府. 賦, 布也. 私, 愛也.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_008_ko_008_0040_0010", "id": null, "offset": 51, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 4, "text": "高注: 分財, 分有與無也. 棄責, 責己不責彼也. 振, 救也. 矜寡孤獨曰窮, 無衣食曰困.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_008_ko_008_0040_0010", "id": null, "offset": 58, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 5, "text": "高注: 以其忠諫而見殺, 故封崇其墓, 以章賢也.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_008_ko_008_0040_0010", "id": null, "offset": 65, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 6, "text": "高注: 以箕子避亂, 佯狂而犇, 故淸淨其宮以異之也.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_008_ko_008_0040_0010", "id": null, "offset": 72, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 7, "text": "高注: 商容, 殷之賢人, 老子師也, 故表異其閭里.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_008_ko_008_0040_0010", "id": null, "offset": 84, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 8, "text": "高注: 過商容之里者趨, 車載者下也.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_008_ko_008_0050_0010", "id": null, "offset": 68, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "高注: 箕子忠臣而疏遠之, 姑息之臣而與近之.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_008_ko_008_0050_0010", "id": null, "offset": 80, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "高注: 方, 道.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_008_ko_008_0050_0010", "id": null, "offset": 92, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 3, "text": "高注: 剖比干之心, 折材士之股, 刳孕婦而觀其胞.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_008_ko_008_0050_0010", "id": null, "offset": 110, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 4, "text": "高注: 周國在豐·鎬也.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_008_ko_008_0060_0010", "id": null, "offset": 32, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "高注: 精, 微妙也.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_008_ko_008_0060_0010", "id": null, "offset": 40, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "高注: 爲紂所困.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_008_ko_008_0070_0010", "id": null, "offset": 38, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "高注: 成王幼少, 周公攝政. 勤心國家, 以致太平. 管叔, 周公弟也. 蔡叔, 周公兄也, 流言作亂. 東夷八國, 附從二叔, 不聽王命. 周公居攝三年, 伐奄, 八國之中最大, 著在 『尙書』. 餘七國小, 又先服, 故不載於經也.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_008_ko_008_0070_0010", "id": null, "offset": 52, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "高注: 喩微細也.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_008_ko_008_0070_0010", "id": null, "offset": 66, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 3, "text": "高注: 過, 失也.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_008_ko_008_0080_0010", "id": null, "offset": 11, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "高注: 以世詭辯, 反白爲黑, 而主不知, 故死.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_008_ko_008_0080_0010", "id": null, "offset": 21, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "高注: 箕子, 紂之庶父也. 商容, 紂時賢人, 老子所從學者也. 以主不知, 故窮.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_008_ko_008_0090_0010", "id": null, "offset": 7, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "高注: 朝鮮·樂浪之縣, 箕子所封, 濱於東海也.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_008_ko_008_0090_0010", "id": null, "offset": 14, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "高注: 東方曰夷, 穢, 夷國名.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_008_ko_008_0090_0010", "id": "ko_008_0090_0010_0001", "offset": 22, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 3, "text": "其: 여조양(呂調陽)은 ‘其’를 ‘共’으로 읽어야 한다고 주장하며 『일주서(逸周書)』 「왕회해(王會解)」의 “共人玄貝”를 인용하였다. 陳奇猷 역시 이에 동조하였다(陳奇猷 校釋, 2002, 『呂氏春秋新校釋』, 1336-1337쪽).", "type": "번역주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_008_ko_008_0090_0010", "id": null, "offset": 42, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 4, "text": "高注: 東方之夷, 無有君長.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_008_ko_008_0100_0010", "id": null, "offset": 22, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "高注: 榑木, 大木也. 津, 崖也. 『淮南子』曰: 「日出陽谷.」 靑羌, 東方之野也. .", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_008_ko_008_0100_0010", "id": null, "offset": 34, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "高注: 山高至天也.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_008_ko_008_0100_0010", "id": null, "offset": 49, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 3, "text": "高注: 東方其人齒黑, 因曰黑齒之國也.", "type": "원주"}
